    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af04c575b7c4709bfe2ddf1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>到了一年一度的双十一，我们又把各平台的“已购宝贝”从头翻了个遍，翻出不少今年买过的好东西，想分享给大家。</span></p><p><span>希望大家听得开心，双十一也能买得开心～</span></p><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期地图🗺️（本期超多图预警⚠️）</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">0:02:05</a> 3C数码好物</span></p><ul><li><p><span>图拉斯充电宝</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2HHe1EGlr3-VfKjiMkJzdc68Lw.jpg"></li><li><p><span>多功能电脑支架</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkVJUdmd4x8pNly-8OntTMrCLJ7H.png"></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">0:12:55</a> 家居用品系列</span></p><ul><li><p><span>居家清洁剂：柠檬酸除垢+多功能懒人清洁膏</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjlGGAeSdM7fY-GzlAjzvgKG_fF1.png"></li><li><p><span>万向轮小凳子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm0KVw4wXPxyEyDACQjzB9tsTG-l.jpg"></li><li><p><span>艾草热敷枕头</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftv7qqtL0ec3ac5D8cdl7i1vK24D.jpg"></li><li><p><span>酸奶过滤器</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsc_H12wRtLonS4RymPVtqyCke_C.png"></li><li><p><span>大葱哄睡神器</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuiX5izKqBSiwvJTrNhmK4E3kLsE.png"></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">0:36:44</a> 出行好物</span></p><ul><li><p><span>充气型U型颈枕</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhqx4FMrPHOSwRf2fQEgCm84AVn-.jpg"></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">0:39:33</a> 猫咪好物</span></p><ul><li><p><span>自动喂食器+自动饮水机</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhbyD0P3HNRd4CmAjDnIk4z5UJBJ.png"></li><li><p><span>猫狗餐台增高架</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqs9GTnyCY7KmQWh8Y7FCEJ7BHaW.jpg"></li><li><p><span>猫咪粘毛器</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohjYii9QiHA7rJLt82PJsJG-MoV.png"></li><li><p><span>猫咪双肩背包</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrrtN8Z57jHu4fAsUDnu6OyyIHY4.jpg"></li><li><p><span>宠物除臭剂</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmsAS2-jk6V3bO6C2tk035mq1Rpm.jpg"></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3465">0:57:45</a> 情绪好物分享</span></p><ul><li><p><span>挂轴年历计划表</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjSvoTrxOVmr_0dbFjMJccf8QpGU.png"></li><li><p><span>马赛克冰箱贴</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmgAhS2V8pUmxUaXcCkqGH4BhWQH.jpg"></li><li><p><span>温湿度计室内外时钟</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fughn8DmB-qdyQppr1IL_6qd6i0e.png"></li><li><p><span>马库斯梅里特修道山居雷司令白葡萄酒</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGd2qNqCYPQDI2x0bD6-lwgOLs1.jpg" alt=""></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4318">1:11:58</a> 彩蛋分享</span></p><ul><li><p><span>檀木头皮按摩梳</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2F2n82l1YdqBpbi4BbWIxYjvLU.png"></li></ul><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期BGM🎵</span></p></blockquote><p><span>灵山村帮《钟意买嘢》</span></p>]]></description>
