  <item>
    <title>Vol.69 办公室摸鱼指南 (老板别听</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad6347566729f5c712dfaf8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad6347566729f5c712dfaf8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>老肖时隔三月重回坐班，首日如坐针毡；大风国庆假期综合症迟迟不退，踩点下班成日常。</span></p><p><span>本期咱们唠唠办公室摸鱼招数，全是打工人心照不宣的工位生存技巧。老板你就别点进来啦！</span></p><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期地图🗺️</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 好巧，你办公室的凳子也长针啦？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 出门透气流：便利店买水、抽烟区唠嗑、早餐大法好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 工位隐身流：带薪拉屎、多窗口伪装，假装好忙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 高阶玩法：空档期看书、外出公干顺路逛，摸鱼也光明正大 </span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a> 合理摸鱼劳逸结合，活是永远干不完哒！</span></p><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期BGM🎵</span></p></blockquote><p><span>李克勤《迟大到》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6742db538d1233fb0d939953/lhuCj61MAxYoucx5LzUYxU2TzLph.m4a" length="46801320" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrhC6H1CbqtyRDrKcaJ1lifuIjUI.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
