  <item>
    <title>Vol.68 澳洲抓马之旅｜Bad decisions, Good stories</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aca635c195d838e2aefec55</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aca635c195d838e2aefec55</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年的中秋+国庆，大风凑了个黄金周长假和朋友结伴去澳大利亚旅游，开局直接地狱难度：曼谷转机遇上大暴雨，航班延误不说，全员行李直接没跟上飞机，穿着夏装在十度的墨尔本街头流浪。 接下来崴脚、山顶遇雾打不到车…… 状况连番上演，但也撞见了绝美的玻璃海、软萌的袋熊、漫天银河和极光，还收获了陌生人的善意。 </span></p><p><span>一句话概括了这堂“澳囧之旅 —— Bad decisions, Good stories! </span></p><p><span>（这期的故事真的很有意思）</span></p><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期地图🗺️</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a> 天崩开局：曼谷转机暴雨延误，全机行李不翼而飞 </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lurpsI8YH7g7eYlviGjHgNzXhAQs.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 崴脚插曲：为了拍帅哥我出尽洋相，解锁机场轮椅体验 </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkezqORuDw-WD_Lqlx71pBP3s9Bh.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgm7EzFWWEIa5ylZ1BJVEBmCJnFY.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 山顶奇遇：惠灵顿山起大雾打不到车，偶遇好心人搭救下山</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiGq88nLIonGt9zu_cGQO6nHlyCP.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2439">40:39</a> 旅程高光：玛利亚岛玻璃海，野生袋熊遍地跑 </span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl26E9z75U5nd23C842Cq3EVirMR.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiF3YGXcFVA1IP42q3WPfR61_BIH.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 浪漫收尾：塔州深夜追极光成功！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhMi53l9G_g-tWPFZk8bGFtE4025.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3047">50:47</a> 真的是超级难忘的塞翁失马了！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv41h-CRGc46ZhJFDyZqyxfXDrH6.jpg"><blockquote><p><span>本期BGM🎵</span></p></blockquote><p><span>Troye Sivan《YOUTH》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6742db538d1233fb0d939953/lkWpdw5O7at9dYdI12LFuwoJlX-w.m4a" length="56614112" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqluBAQpW32_H-BGL5QEDQEYeURM.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.67 离职后真的更自由了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abb4856195d838e2aeb7002</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6abb4856195d838e2aeb7002</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不知不觉，老肖已经离职四个月。当初毅然决定裸辞的老肖，真的拥有了想要的自由和快乐吗？这期我们就一起来聊聊，裸辞后的老肖到底过得怎么样？</span></p><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期地图🗺️</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 裸辞后都在干什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 项目制是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 在“只出不入”的日子，对消费会有什么影响？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> 离职后真的更加自由了吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 现在的老肖快乐吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 做出选择前，要做好生活基础的规划</span></p><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期BGM🎵</span></p></blockquote><p><span>林奕匡《叄十岁前要完成的事》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6742db538d1233fb0d939953/lmXAC0olDUgKckPWmZhHoHbQsp8u.m4a" length="43082696" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvcHBbbl-Z9xF8Lv098NmagoImu2.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
