  <item>
    <title>Vol.66 新手猫妈上线，大风有猫了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aaec804ac389df827346b0c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aaec804ac389df827346b0c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期纯纯是大风的养猫分享局。心心念念了很久的阿比西尼亚猫，因为一场意料之外的领养缘分提前报到。</span></p><p><span>从手忙脚乱到被猫咪彻底治愈，一只小猫的到来，给生活填满了软乎乎的幸福感~ </span></p><p><span>啊！我终于不是没猫的野人了！！</span></p><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期地图🗺️</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> 大风喜提猫儿子！欢迎——阿比西尼亚「金砖」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 缘分突降：居然是公司飞书群带来的机缘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a> 刚到家的时候是黏人跟屁虫小天使，适应了之后是跑酷大王！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1212">20:12</a> 新手初挑战：猫咪突发尿血紧急就医！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 我爱给我的猫花钱：自动喂食器、水碗、猫包、监控……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 治愈日常：养猫之后，生活里多了软乎乎的牵挂</span></p><p></p><p><span>🥳快来看看我们帅气的金砖宝宝！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnzMa3A-ADOywuWwHRBSW_HAJ4Py.jpg"><p><span>本期BGM🎵</span></p><p><span>林家谦《流离者的海》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6742db538d1233fb0d939953/lp2v8RPaAkRjwqlyuxd0hzOefkZE.m4a" length="54278480" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:56</itunes:duration>
