  <item>
    <title>Vol.62 有事没事，AI一下</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a79f0ee17676351c56fd0c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a79f0ee17676351c56fd0c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“问一下豆包吧。”</span><br><span>“等一下，我问问DeepSeek。”</span></p><p><span>不知道从什么时候开始，这句话已经成了我们遇到问题时的本能反应。从正儿八经的工作难题，到脑子里突然蹦出的离谱疑问——手指比脑子快，对话框已经打开了。</span></p><p><span>这期我们一起来分享我们到底跟AI聊过哪些奇怪的话题。也欢迎在评论区分享：你问过AI最奇怪的问题是什么？</span></p><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期地图🗺️</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> “日入一万月工作三天的工作”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fli5e4VcWZxqGH1e-Bt3SxPN4Oe-.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> “外卖包装进微波炉”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl04W6cNIYpBKRmO0dRCCOe_UkOq.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a> “刮痧和拔火罐的原理”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniJskKiE74IOnehkBhqEowepAnb.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1814">30:14</a> “马达加斯加语言”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1Jaok2CPq_gICAFuTcBJYVNoTi.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">34:47</a> “SWOLF值是什么”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszuPB9Y740AFN6kfZVctUjhyKtR.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2256">37:36</a> “迪迦奥特曼的家人情况”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhTM2AFPN0-CgOr2UNWCX_20KzFN.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a> AI搜索的利弊</span></p><ul><li><p><span>快速信息检索、要点对比</span></p></li><li><p><span>不要太依赖AI工具</span></p></li><li><p><span>要判别提供信息的正误</span></p></li></ul><p></p><blockquote><p><span>本期BGM🎵</span></p></blockquote><p><span>农夫《全民合拍》</span></p>]]></description>
